|                                                                             |
|o1 = Digraph{1 => {}    }                                                    |
|             2 => {1}                                                        |
|             3 => {1}                                                        |
|             4 => {2, 3}                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Digraph                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = markovRing (2,2,2,2) -- this ring corresponds to four binary random |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = R                                                                       |
