|                                                                |
|o10 : PolynomialRing                                            |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : S = covarianceMatrix R                                    |
|                                                                |
|o11 = |  s     s     s     s     |                              |
|      |   a,a   a,b   a,c   a,d  |                              |
|      |                          |                              |
|      |  s     s     s     s     |                              |
|      |   a,b   b,b   b,c   b,d  |                              |
|      |                          |                              |
|      |  s     s     s     s     |                              |
|      |   a,c   b,c   c,c   c,d  |                              |
|      |                          |                              |
|      |  s     s     s     s     |                              |
|      |   a,d   b,d   c,d   d,d  |                              |
|                                                                |
|              4      4                                          |
|o11 : Matrix R  <-- R                                           |
