directedEdgesMatrix -- matrix corresponding to the directed edges of a digraph or a mixed graph
***********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        directedEdgesMatrix R
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, which should be a gaussianRing
        created with a *note digraph: (Graphs)Digraph, or an instance of the
        type *note MixedGraph: (StatGraphs)MixedGraph,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the $n \times{} n$ matrix of
        direct causal effect indeterminates.

Description
===========

This method returns the  $n \times{} n$ matrix of direct causal effect
indeterminates. This matrix has the parameter $l_{(i,j)}$ in the $(i,j)$
position if there is a directed edge $i \to j$, and 0 otherwise. Note that this
matrix is not symmetric. The documentation of *note gaussianRing: gaussianRing,
further describes the indeterminates $l_{(i,j)}$.



+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = mixedGraph(digraph {{b,{c,d}},{c,{d}}},bigraph {{a,d}})|
|                                                                |
|o1 = MixedGraph{Bigraph => Bigraph{a => {d}}   }                |
|                                   d => {a}                     |
|                Digraph => Digraph{b => {c, d}}                 |
|                                   c => {d}                     |
|                                   d => {}                      |
|                Graph => Graph{}                                |
|                                                                |
|o1 : MixedGraph                                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = gaussianRing G                                         |
|                                                                |
|o2 = R                                                          |
|                                                                |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                             |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : compactMatrixForm =false;                                  |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : directedEdgesMatrix R                                      |
|                                                                |
|o4 = |  0  0    0     0   |                                     |
|     |                    |                                     |
|     |  0  0  l     l     |                                     |
|     |         b,c   b,d  |                                     |
|     |                    |                                     |
|     |  0  0    0   l     |                                     |
|     |               c,d  |                                     |
|     |                    |                                     |
|     |  0  0    0     0   |                                     |
|                                                                |
|             4      4                                           |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                                            |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : D = digraph{{a,b},{c,d}}                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = Digraph{a => {b}}                                                       |
|             b => {}                                                         |
|             c => {d}                                                        |
|             d => {}                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Digraph                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : directedEdgesMatrix gaussianRing D                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = |  0  l     0    0   |                                                  |
|     |      a,b           |                                                  |
|     |                    |                                                  |
|     |  0    0   0    0   |                                                  |
|     |                    |                                                  |
|     |  0    0   0  l     |                                                  |
|     |               c,d  |                                                  |
|     |                    |                                                  |
|     |  0    0   0    0   |                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Matrix (QQ[l   , l   , p   , p   , p   , p   , s   ..s   , s   ..s   ,  |
|                 a,b   c,d   a,a   b,b   c,c   d,d   a,a   a,d   b,b   b,d   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                  4                                                          |
|s   ..s   , s   ])  <-- (QQ[l   , l   , p   , p   , p   , p   , s   ..s   ,  |
| c,c   c,d   d,d             a,b   c,d   a,a   b,b   c,c   d,d   a,a   a,d   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                              4                                              |
|s   ..s   , s   ..s   , s   ])                                               |
| b,b   b,d   c,c   c,d   d,d                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

