graphType -- class of graph used to generate a gaussian ring
************************************************************

Description
===========

For a gaussianRing R generated with a *note digraph: (Graphs)Digraph, and an
instance of the type *note Bigraph: (StatGraphs)Bigraph, the class we retrieve
when typing R.graph is MixedGraph. This is consistent with the treatment of
such objects. Therefore, this variable is essentially used to differentiate
graphs from a *note graph: (Graphs)Graph, and an instance of the type *note
MixedGraph: (StatGraphs)MixedGraph,.

