********************************************

  * Usage: 
        inverseMarginMap(i,R)
  * Inputs:
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the index of the variable for
        which to undo the "margin trick"
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, a markovRing
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring map: (Macaulay2Doc)RingMap,, 

Description
===========

This method computes the inverse of the *note marginMap: marginMap,.



